{
  "schema_version": "pipeline-export/1",
  "_comment": "Cortex 13-agent GitHub Issue Pipeline expressed as a DAP bundle.\n\nARCHITECTURE\n  Phase 1 (enrichment): mockup → specify → cicd → dispatcher → finalize\n  [human gate]\n  Phase 2 (execution):  coder → designer → documenter\n  [human gate]\n  Phase 3 (merge):      code_reviewer → tester → pr_creator → reviewer\n  [human gate]\n  pr_merger\n\nSTATE CONTRACT\n  Cortex-specific fields (issue_url, repo, issue_number, run_id, …)\n  live in PipelineState.extensions so the generic schema is not polluted.\n  Each node reads extensions via the cortex.state_adapter module.\n\nDEPENDENCIES\n  dap-cortex package must be installed in the DAP engine venv:\n    pip install dap-cortex  (or: uv add dap-cortex)\n  Source: https://github.com/Dixter999/cortex-project\n  Environment variables required (same as standalone cortex run):\n    CORTEX_GH_TOKEN_READ, CORTEX_GH_TOKEN_ISSUES, CORTEX_GH_TOKEN_CODE,\n    CORTEX_GH_TOKEN_MERGE, CORTEX_DATABASE_URL",
